<view class="page onboarding">
  <block wx:if="{{step === 1}}">
    <view class="ob-hero enter">
      <view class="ob-tag en">WELCOME · 英语精读喵</view>
      <text class="ob-title">先告诉我，你在备战哪一级</text>
      <text class="ob-sub">选好之后，猫按这一级的难度挑文章，词汇和语法点也按这个标准筛，不会一上来就给你超纲的长难句。</text>
      <view class="ob-photo">
        <view class="ob-photo-tape"></view>
        <cat-image name="welcome-wave" size="large" custom-class="ob-cat" />
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="level-list">
      <view
        wx:for="{{levels}}"
        wx:key="key"
        class="level-card enter"
        hover-class="level-card-hover"
        bind:tap="chooseLevel"
        data-level="{{item.key}}"
      >
        <view class="level-stamp en">{{item.full}}</view>
        <view class="level-copy">
          <text class="level-name">{{item.label}}</text>
          <text class="level-desc">{{item.desc}}</text>
        </view>
        <view class="level-arrow"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="ob-note">
      <text>题库内置 2013–2026 四六级真题，打开就能练；真题原文著作权归考试主办方，仅供个人学习。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="ob-skip" bind:tap="skip">
      <text>以后再说</text>
    </view>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="ob-hero enter">
      <view class="ob-tag en">STEP 02 · SOURCE</view>
      <text class="ob-title">今天从哪一篇开始</text>
      <text class="ob-sub">抽一篇按难度分好级的文章，或者把手上整理好的文章导进来。</text>
      <view class="ob-level-chip" bind:tap="backToLevel">
        <text class="ob-level-text en">{{levelLabel}}</text>
        <text class="ob-level-change">更换</text>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="source-list">
      <view class="source-card enter d1" hover-class="source-card-hover" bind:tap="draw">
        <view class="source-sticker">
          <cat-image name="reading-highlight" size="small" custom-class="source-cat" />
        </view>
        <view class="source-copy">
          <text class="source-title">随机抽一篇</text>
          <text class="source-desc">从题库里抽一篇，直接进词汇站</text>
        </view>
        <view class="source-arrow"></view>
      </view>

      <view class="source-card enter d2" hover-class="source-card-hover" bind:tap="goImport">
        <view class="source-sticker">
          <cat-image name="import-book" size="small" custom-class="source-cat" />
        </view>
        <view class="source-copy">
          <text class="source-title">导入我的文章</text>
          <text class="source-desc">支持 Word（.docx）与 PDF</text>
        </view>
        <view class="source-arrow"></view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ob-error enter">{{error}}</view>

    <view class="ob-link" bind:tap="goLibrary">
      <text>先看看题库里都有什么</text>
      <view class="ob-link-arrow"></view>
    </view>
  </block>

  <view wx:if="{{starting}}" class="ob-mask">
    <view class="ob-mask-card">
      <cat-image name="sleepy-nap" size="medium" />
      <text class="ob-mask-title">猫正在翻这篇文章</text>
      <text class="ob-mask-text">{{startingTitle}}</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
